(4) No. expenditure shall be made from the funds ofthe Institute,unless a'bill for its payments has been issued by the head of the Cost Centreconcerned in accordance with the relevant statutes and the Treasurer hasverified that the payment is provided for in the approved budget of-the costCentre, subject to the authority to re-appropriate available to the head of thecost Centre.
